# Design-tool export drops. The two bundles they contain are checked in under
# src-bundles/ instead; keeping the originals out of the repo matters because
# GitHub Pages publishes every tracked file, and these are ~2 MB each.
Personal page redesign/
Personal page redesign.zip
*.zip

# sharp, installed on demand for tools/make-overrides.mjs and never committed:
# the build itself has no dependencies and this repo has no package.json, so
# node_modules/ should only ever exist while regenerating the photographs.
node_modules/

# Local preview / diagnostics
_frame.html
_diag.html
_preview.html
_navprobe.html
_icons.html
_icons/

# Machine-local editor settings. Worth keeping untracked on this repo in
# particular: GitHub Pages serves every committed file over HTTP, and the
# permission rules in here quote local Windows paths and the account name.
.claude/
